## INTUITION

Height of a node:

```
1 + maximum(
        height(left),
        height(right)
    )
```

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## CORE FORMULA

```
height(node)
    =
1 + max(
    height(left),
    height(right)
)
```

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## BASE CASE

If:

```
node == NULL
```

