# THE MOST IMPORTANT DP SIMILARITIES

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

## CLIMBING STAIRS

```
LAST MOVE
   │
   ├── 1
   └── 2

    ↓

dp[i-1] + dp[i-2]
```

## HOUSE ROBBER

```
CURRENT
   │
   ├── TAKE
   └── SKIP

    ↓

max(
    dp[i-2] + current,
    dp[i-1]
)
```

## KNAPSACK

```
CURRENT ITEM
   │
   ├── TAKE
   └── SKIP

    ↓

max(
    take,
    skip
)
```

